/**
 * crypto_data_processor.cpp - A CLI tool to update JSON files and MySQL database records in batches.
 *
 * This program processes JSON files originally generated by Crypto-DataLayer. It performs:
 * 1. Replaces the elapsedTime field with actual min and max ts values from the data
 * 2. Sets extend.true_elapsedTime to true
 * 3. Optionally sorts the root.data array based on timestamp (enabled by default)
 * 4. Renames files from <filePrefix>-[old_start]-[old_end].json to <filePrefix>-[new_start]-[new_end].json
 * 5. Updates MySQL database elapsedStartTime and elapsedEndTime fields in batches (optional)
 */

